duplicated in rows.csv); Tableau N°89 top-10 crimes by prison 2023."},"instat_tbse_alaotra_mangoro_2023":{"name":"Tableau de bord socio-économique de la Région Alaotra Mangoro 2023 (édition octobre 2024)","publisher":"INSTAT Madagascar with DRAP Alaotra Mangoro","url":"https://www.instat.mg/documents/upload/main/TBSE_AlaotraMangoro_04Dec2024.pdf","licence":"no licence stated","years":"2022-2023","notes":"Tableau N°60 top-10 crimes, prévenu/condamné, 2022 and 2023, region total only."},"instat_tbse_alaotra_mangoro_2024":{"name":"Tableau de bord socio-économique de la Région Alaotra Mangoro 2024 (édition décembre 2025)","publisher":"INSTAT Madagascar with DRAP Alaotra Mangoro","url":"https://www.instat.mg/documents/upload/main/TBSE_AlaotraMangoro_Dec2025.pdf","licence":"no licence stated","years":"2023-2024","notes":"Tableau N°77 top-10 crimes, prévenu/condamné, 2023 and 2024, region total only. 2023 values repeat Tableau N°60 of the 2023 edition."}},"dict":{"b":["Total","Prévenus (remand)","Condamnés (convicted)","Total (prévenus+condamnés, all prisons)","Prévenu (remand)","Condamné (convicted)"],"m":["Persons killed in mob justice (vindicte populaire), gendarmerie-recorded","Cases of mob justice (vindicte populaire), gendarmerie-recorded","Prisoners held for \"Assassinat\" (DRAP, regional prison administration)","Prisoners held for \"Meurtre (Avec vol)\" (DRAP, regional prison administration)","Prisoners held for \"Meurtre\" (DRAP, regional prison administration)","Prisoners held for \"Coup mortel\" (DRAP, regional prison administration)","Prisoners held for \"Coups mortels\" (DRAP, regional prison administration)","Prisoners held for \"Homicide volontaire\" (DRAP, regional prison administration)"],"u":["count"],"s":["instat_tbse_atsinanana_2024","instat_tbse_atsinanana_2023","instat_tbse_alaotra_mangoro_2023","instat_tbse_alaotra_mangoro_2024"],"c":["2021","2022","2023","2024"]},"problems":"# MDG Madagascar — partial: regional dashboards only (no national homicide-by-region table found)\n\nWhat was found (all opened by direct download from instat.mg):\n- INSTAT publishes \"Tableau de bord socio-économique\" (TBSE) PDFs for only three of the 23 régions so far: Atsinanana, Alaotra Mangoro, Analanjirofo (editions 2023 and 2024), listed at https://www.instat.mg/statistiques/annuaires-statistiques/item/annuaire-statistique (20 pages crawled).\n- Atsinanana: a Sécurité section from the Gendarmerie circonscription of Toamasina with \"vindicte populaire\" (mob justice) cases and persons killed 2021–2024 — the only direct death count; and a Justice section from the regional prison administration (DRAP) listing the top-10 offences by prison (MC Toamasina, MC Vatomandry, MC Mahanoro) with prisoners on remand (prévenus) and convicted (condamnés) for \"Meurtre\", \"Assassinat\", \"Coup mortel\".\n- Alaotra Mangoro: same DRAP top-10 table, region total only (Meurtre, Assassinat, Coups mortels, Homicide volontaire), 2022–2024.\n- Analanjirofo: no crime/justice tables (its DRSP is the health directorate); nothing to extract.\n\nCaveats for the owner:\n- The DRAP rows are prisoner stocks (people held for an offence), not offences recorded or deaths. They are entered because they are the only official sub-national homicide-related figures found; the measure column says so. Top-10 lists omit an offence when it falls outside the top ten (e.g. \"Coups mortels\" absent for 2024 in Alaotra Mangoro) — absence is not zero.\n- Blank cells (MC Mahanoro 2024; Meurtre condamné 2022 in Alaotra Mangoro) are published blank and left blank.\n- \"Meurtre (Avec vol)\" label is as printed in the 2024 Atsinanana table.\n- No licence statement in any PDF.\n\nNot found: a national table of homicide by région/district. The INSTAT site has no \"Annuaire statistique\" of Madagascar after 1938-1951; its annuaire listing is ministry yearbooks (health, education, water, etc.). The MSANP \"Annuaire des statistiques du secteur santé\" 2024 is listed (https://www.instat.mg/p/msanp-annuaire-des-statistiques-du-secteur-sante-de-madagascar-2024) but was not opened in this session — it may hold deaths by cause by région and is the next thing to check. Police Nationale / Gendarmerie national reports were not located (web search budget for the turn was exhausted before any Madagascar query).","unmatched":4,"shapes":{"shapes_ADM1.geojson":{"source":"geoBoundaries gbOpen MDG ADM1","url":"https://github.com/wmgeolab/geoBoundaries/raw/9469f09/releaseData/gbOpen/MDG/ADM1/geoBoundaries-MDG-ADM1.geojson","licence":"Open Data Commons Open Database License 1.0","year":"2017"}}}